<body>
<div class="pov-shell">
  <header class="pov-header">
    <div class="pov-brand">TikTok Shop Decision Tree</div>
    <div>by <a href="https://getworkfriends.co/">Workfriends</a></div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="pov-hero">
      <div class="pov-kicker">THE UPSIDE IS REAL. SO IS THE COST OF GETTING IT WRONG.</div>
      <h1>Get TikTok Shop right.</h1>
      <p class="lead">TikTok Shop can be a powerful revenue accelerator. But the wrong product strategy, operating model or partner can cost months of learning and meaningful capital.</p>
      <a class="pov-btn" href="#find-path">Find the right path →</a>
      <div class="pov-note">Free TikTok Shop Gut Check. No obligation.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="pov-section">
      <div class="pov-eyebrow">BEFORE WE RECOMMEND ANYONE</div>
      <h2>First, does the opportunity make sense?</h2>
      <p class="pov-lead">Not everything is selling on TikTok Shop right now. Before choosing an operator, we look at the market and the economics around your business.</p>
      <div class="pov-grid4">
        <article class="pov-card">
          <div class="pov-eyebrow">PRODUCT</div>
          <h3>What can actually sell?</h3>
          <p>Your hero products, price point, proof of demand and readiness to ship all matter.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="pov-card">
          <div class="pov-eyebrow">CATEGORY</div>
          <h3>Who's already winning?</h3>
          <p>Who is selling more, at what price, with which products and how quickly the category is moving.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="pov-card">
          <div class="pov-eyebrow">CREATORS</div>
          <h3>Who is driving demand?</h3>
          <p>How many creators are selling, who matters in the category and what it takes to activate the right people.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="pov-card">
          <div class="pov-eyebrow">ECONOMICS</div>
          <h3>What will the machine require?</h3>
          <p>Creator investment, GMV Max, operating costs and whether you're prepared to invest before the channel reaches profitability.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pov-section" id="find-path">
      <div class="pov-contact">
        <div class="pov-contact-copy">
          <div class="pov-eyebrow">FIND THE RIGHT PATH</div>
          <h2>Tell us what's going on.</h2>
          <p>Tell us what you're trying to figure out. Kevin will review it personally and help you pressure-test the opportunity before you commit more time or money.</p>
          <p><strong>Not sure what you need?</strong> That's a good place to start.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="pov-form" action="https://formsubmit.co/kevin@getworkfriends.co" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="TikTok Shop Decision Tree inquiry">
          <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false">
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input id="name" name="name" type="text" required>
          <label for="email">Work email</label>
          <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required>
          <label for="company">Company</label>
          <input id="company" name="company" type="text" required>
          <label for="type">Company type</label>
          <select id="type" name="company_type" required>
            <option value="">Select one</option>
            <option>Brand</option>
            <option>Agency</option>
          </select>
