    <section class="pov-section">
      <div class="pov-eyebrow">THE PATH DEPENDS ON THE BUSINESS</div>
      <h2>There isn't one right model.</h2>
      <p class="pov-lead">Once the opportunity is clear, the answer may be to bring in an operator, own the capability, acquire it, combine specialists or improve what you already have.</p>
      <div class="pov-paths">
        <article class="pov-path"><h3>Partner</h3><p>Bring in the right operator.</p></article>
        <article class="pov-path"><h3>Build</h3><p>Own the capability internally.</p></article>
        <article class="pov-path"><h3>Buy</h3><p>Acquire capability or infrastructure.</p></article>
        <article class="pov-path"><h3>Stack</h3><p>Combine the capabilities that fit.</p></article>
        <article class="pov-path"><h3>Improve</h3><p>Fix and strengthen what you already have.</p></article>
