          <p>In most cases, yes, especially with a cold start. TikTok Shop is powered by creators, affiliates, LIVE, content and commerce working together. Traditional ecommerce experience alone does not guarantee TikTok Shop expertise. The bigger question is who is actually right for your business.</p>
